  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對於寶可夢的屬性，\n我終於得到一個結論了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D65BC5BF653EF592276845C6C6027FF0C000A62117D4265BC5F9752304E00500B7D508AD64E86300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就是，一般屬性才是最強的！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C31662FFF0C4E00822C5C6C6027624D662F67005F377684FF01FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "一般屬性幾乎沒有\n不拿手的對手屬性。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E00822C5C6C60275E7E4E4E6C926709000A4E0D62FF624B76845C0D624B5C6C6027300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也就是說，不論是面對什麼樣的對手，\n它都能全方位地兵來將擋，水來土掩。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F5C31662F8AAAFF0C4E0D8AD6662F97625C0D4EC09EBC6A2376845C0D624BFF0C000A5B8390FD80FD516865B94F4D573051754F865C0764CBFF0C6C344F86571F63A9300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我曾經在各個地區旅行，\n和五花八門的寶可夢對戰過。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n這樣的我所說的話，準沒錯的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621166FE7D9357285404500B5730534065C5884CFF0C000A548C4E9482B1516B958076845BF653EF59225C0D6230904E300200100001BE00000A90196A237684621162408AAA76848A71FF0C6E966C92932F7684300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不然，我這就與<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳對戰，\n證明一下我的一般屬性最強論吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D7136FF0C621190195C31820700100003110000FF01014F6059B35C0D6230FF0C000A8B49660E4E004E0B621176844E00822C5C6C602767005F378AD65427FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "麻煩<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好之後，\n就來告訴我一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9EBB716900100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D4E4B5F8CFF0C000A5C314F86544A8A3462114E0080725427300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要證明我的一般屬性最強論囉。\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621189818B49660E621176844E00822C5C6C602767005F378AD656C93002000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D4E8655CEFF1F00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D4E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "還沒",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90846C920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請紮紮實實地準備一番。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7D2E7D2E5BE65BE657306E9650994E00756A300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的寶可夢全都是一般屬性！\n不管面對什麼屬性的對手，應該都能獲勝。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845BF653EF5922516890FD662F4E00822C5C6C6027FF01000A4E0D7BA197625C0D4EC09EBC5C6C602776845C0D624BFF0C61C98A7290FD80FD737252DD300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "果然還是得要追求更能夠\n占上風的屬性才行嗎……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "679C71369084662F5F9789818FFD6C4266F480FD5920000A53604E0A98A876845C6C6027624D884C55CE2026202600100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但老實說……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4680015BE68AAA2026202600100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我一點都記不住屬性的相剋關係！\n它的組合未免也太多了吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 992,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E009EDE90FD8A184E0D4F4F5C6C6027768476F8524B95DC4FC2FF01000A5B8376847D445408672A514D4E5F592A591A4E865427FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "告訴我！<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是把屬性的相剋關係\n都記得清清楚楚嗎！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "544A8A346211FF0100100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F628A5C6C6027768476F8524B95DC4FC2000A90FD8A185F976E056E05695A695A55CEFF01FF1F00100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "清清楚楚",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E056E05695A695A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我沒自信",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62116C9281EA4FE10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳真是個了不起的訓練家！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1156,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3771F662F500B4E864E0D8D7776848A137DF45BB6FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大家都是半斤八兩對吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59275BB690FD662F534A65A4516B51695C0D5427300200100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我只要始終不渝地貫徹一般屬性！\n即使不是最強，也該是萬能的！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EA898159CB7D424E0D6E1D57308CAB5FB94E00822C5C6C6027FF01000A53734F7F4E0D662F67005F37FF0C4E5F8A72662F842C80FD7684FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不過，有個屬性是\n一般屬性的招式完全沒效果的……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那就是幽靈屬性！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D904EFF0C6709500B5C6C6027662F000A4E00822C5C6C6027768462DB5F0F5B8C51686C926548679C76842026202600100001BE00000A90A35C31662F5E7D97485C6C6027FF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要是一般屬性的招式\n能對幽靈屬性有效果的話……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那我就能打遍天下了說！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŤ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981662F4E00822C5C6C6027768462DB5F0F000A80FD5C0D5E7D97485C6C602767096548679C76848A712026202600100001BE00000A90A362115C3180FD6253904D59294E0B4E868AAAFF0100100002011401640000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
